diff --git a/projects/awsome-ai-gateway/deployment/observability/README.md b/projects/awsome-ai-gateway/deployment/observability/README.md
index 7a543dc2..00d58c8a 100644
--- a/projects/awsome-ai-gateway/deployment/observability/README.md
